Portions of this package are ported from the Anonymizator browser extension,
Copyright 2026 Prosecco 37 d.o.o., and are contributed under the MIT licence
with the permission of Prosecco 37 d.o.o. The ported portions are:

- the substitution engine (placeholder allocation, PERSON name sub-placeholders,
  masking and reveal), from lib/anonymizer.js and lib/id-set.js, in
  nodes/Anonymizator/shared/anonymizer.ts;
- the ID set model and its rules (types and placeholder prefixes, legal forms,
  own-placeholder test, company names), from lib/id-model.js, lib/id-rules.js
  and lib/id-names.js, in nodes/Anonymizator/shared/idModel.ts;
- the Protect pipeline (prefixes, reserved placeholders, relabelling and
  masking), from lib/id-edits.js, in
  nodes/Anonymizator/shared/protectPipeline.ts;
- the rules for numbers, currency values and company names ("Additionally
  protect"), from lib/extra-detect.js, in nodes/Anonymizator/shared/extraDetect.ts;
- the possible IDs, from lib/id-possible.js, in
  nodes/Anonymizator/shared/possible.ts;
- the HPKE (RFC 9180) request sealing, the wire format and the keyconfig and
  capabilities verification, from lib/hpke.js, in
  nodes/Anonymizator/shared/hpke.ts, nodes/Anonymizator/shared/keyconfig.ts and
  nodes/Anonymizator/shared/capabilities.ts;
- the gateway client logic (keyconfig acquisition, sealed analyze requests,
  status handling, capabilities), from lib/gateway.js and lib/capabilities.js,
  in nodes/Anonymizator/shared/gateway.ts and
  nodes/Anonymizator/shared/capabilities.ts;
- the splitting of long texts into parts and the merging of their results,
  from lib/chunker.js (the same algorithm as the Anonymizator web app's
  pgw-chunker.js) and the long-text loop of lib/messages.js, in
  nodes/Anonymizator/shared/chunker.ts and nodes/Anonymizator/shared/gateway.ts;
- the error wording, from sidepanel/sidepanel-constants.js, in
  nodes/Anonymizator/shared/gatewayMessages.ts;
- the entity catalog, its merge with the server's capabilities and the entity
  filter, from lib/entities.js, in nodes/Anonymizator/shared/entities.ts;
- the ID file format (versions 1 and 2) and its parse rules, from
  sidepanel/sidepanel-idfile.js, in nodes/Anonymizator/shared/placeholderMap.ts.

Third-party code (EXPERIMENTAL post-quantum encryption, protocol v3)

nodes/Anonymizator/shared/vendor/ (compiled to dist/nodes/Anonymizator/shared/
vendor/) contains a subset of the TypeScript sources of @noble/post-quantum
0.7.1, @noble/hashes 2.4.0 and @noble/curves 2.4.0 (ML-KEM-768, SHA-3 and
SHAKE), taken from the npm tarballs with the edits listed in
vendor-noble.lock.json in the source repository. They are used only when the
credential's experimental Post-Quantum Encryption option is on.

